f $X$ in this case is\n\n$$\nf(x)={\\begin{aligned}{(0.6)}^{x-1}(0.4), & x=1,2,3,… \\\\ 0, & \\text{otherwise}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(X=5) & =f(5) \\\\  & ={(0.6)}^{4}(0.4) \\\\  & ≈0.0518.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-130031/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1d83ab99-0e27-5989-9a57-6b4a192fa4a4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130031"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-332367/field-1/e11268cb5a8cab822077fc26f65e355ec787ab254577fc8c6db52b7839196c1d" :answer/id #uuid "ab9c5056-df8c-53aa-b272-0090e18b9f24" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.1041" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-332367/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "00e548bf-3d88-5a06-805a-07ad417acf47" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-332367/field-1/e11268cb5a8cab822077fc26f65e355ec787ab254577fc8c6db52b7839196c1d" :answer-field/choices ["q-332367/field-1/e11268cb5a8cab822077fc26f65e355ec787ab254577fc8c6db52b7839196c1d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-332367" :question/id #uuid "c05c8527-39e4-5b3c-8d5d-6835397d3c35" :question/math-academy-id "q-332367" :question/problem "Given $X∼\\text{Geom}(\\frac{2}{7}),$ compute $P(X=4).$  Round your final answer to $4$ decimal places.\n\n$P(X=4)≈$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "If $X∼\\text{Geom}(p),$ then $X$ has the following probability mass function:\n\n$$\nf(x)={\\begin{aligned}(1-p)^{x-1}p, & x=1,2,3,… \\\\ 0, & \\text{otherwise}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHere, $X∼\\text{Geom}(\\frac{2}{7}),$ so the distribution of $X$ in this case is\n\n$$\nf(x)={\\begin{aligned}{(\\frac{5}{7})}^{x-1}(\\frac{2}{7}), & x=1,2,3,… \\\\ 0, & \\text{otherwise}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(X=4) & =f(4) \\\\  & ={(\\frac{5}{7})}^{3}(\\frac{2}{7}) \\\\  & ≈0.1041.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficu