(x)={\\begin{aligned}{(0.36)}^{x-1}(0.64), & x=1,2,3,… \\\\ 0, & \\text{otherwise}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(X<5) & =P(X\\in {1,2,3,4}) \\\\  & =P(X=1)+P(X=2)+P(X=3)+P(X=4) \\\\  & =f(1)+f(2)+f(3)+f(4) \\\\  & ={(0.36)}^{0}(0.64)+{(0.36)}^{1}(0.64)+{(0.36)}^{2}(0.64)+{(0.36)}^{3}(0.64) \\\\  & ≈0.9832.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-97146/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "120381af-c472-5894-8b19-da2ab61d3a7e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-97146"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-335457/field-1/29bbf93e997e4ca5efd6d8e1f3373c82becb979816f8cb1c9a50c2b2edd4d9e5" :answer/id #uuid "5e5ad318-ea2d-5959-ab88-f2e08ded19ea" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.3310" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335457/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "e03231fd-ff7d-50f1-a1fb-fd337d2829f8" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-335457/field-1/29bbf93e997e4ca5efd6d8e1f3373c82becb979816f8cb1c9a50c2b2edd4d9e5" :answer-field/choices ["q-335457/field-1/29bbf93e997e4ca5efd6d8e1f3373c82becb979816f8cb1c9a50c2b2edd4d9e5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-335457" :question/id #uuid "269dbb33-4534-5e9e-a758-6d7a7264b6ae" :question/math-academy-id "q-335457" :question/problem "Given that $X∼\\text{Geom}(\\frac{3}{8}),$ compute $P(2<X<7)$ rounded to $4$ decimal places.\n\n$P(2<X<7)≈$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "If $X∼\\text{Geom}(p),$ then $X$ has the following probability mass function:\n\n$$\nf(x)={\\begin{aligned}(1-p)^{x-1}p, & x=1,2,3,… \\\\ 0, & \\text{otherwise}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHere, $X∼\\text{Geom}(\\frac{3}{8}),$ so the distribution of $X$ in this case is\n\n$$\nf(x)={\\begin{aligned}{(\\frac{5}{8})}^{x-1}(\\frac{3}{8}), & x=1,2,3,… \\\\ 0, & \\text{otherwise}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(2<X<7) & =P(X\\in {3,4,5,6}) \\\\  & =P(X=3)+P(X=4)+P(X=5)+P(X=6) \\\\  & =f(3)+f(4)+f(5)+f(6) \\\\  & ={(\\frac{5}{8})}^{2}(\\frac{3}{8})+{(\\frac{5}{8})}^{3}(\\frac{3}{8})+{(\\frac{5}{8})}^{4}(\\frac{3}{8})+{(\\frac{5}{8})}^{5}(\\frac{3}{8}) \\\\  & ≈0.3310.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-335457/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c566525f-9b0f-586f-ba60-277400cb25dd"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-335457"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-97155/selection/83e4a81a8f4e3941fcd93c78d5bb4f551c1e2e7f937e75a23378bce5adc5d9e1" :answer/id #uuid "aa3a3511-f240-55a8-a5b7-03a6d6eb93c8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.3258" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97155/selection/06c1319f6c0101da3823018caa326b0cbe63018250fbcaa415933a9dede54f16" :answer/id #uuid "ac6cc09c-cf9b-5297-b361-cf0a60736014" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.4166" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97155/selection/3d9242b9b3107a5d45823628e3f8bd8dee9e03d1ba0a45a9baf41065bd6acb2a" :answer/id #uuid "143b8ba4-fc16-53be-944e-a2c09f494df8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.2481" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97155/selection/173f34fd11abad5b60a5f6e63baed9de352d1ffb0946eb7d78a42c64c8463f96" :answer/id #uuid "b08e5362-3274-52f3-b344-9f9fc1de0fcf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.2287" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97155/selection/de470e0d3b40ec8b8982e2fd86d01c4a0424b0cd0bd5b95bfd3a3c84eaa4aaad" :answer/id #uuid "491dae5e-a6ff-583f-8c3f-4084a8a26478" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.3004" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97155/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "b450dc1e-c7a0-5f00-b80c-6657edae450c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-97155/selection/3d9242b9b3107a5d45823628e3f8bd8dee9e03d1ba0a45a9baf41065bd6acb2a" :